# Loaded by Vite only in development mode (`pnpm dev` / `vite`). Overrides nothing else in
# .env — Vite merges .env + .env.[mode], mode-specific values win for matching keys. See
# README.md's Development section.

# Local Cloudflare Worker dev server (`cd backend-proxy && npm run dev` — wrangler dev).
VITE_AGENT_PROXY_URL=http://localhost:8787
